URES ]\n- 6 FE creatures built from props: T-Rex, Indoraptor, Monster, Spider, Tiger, Wendigo\n- Mountable creatures with live animations\n- Also in Build: Giant Unicorn, Scorpion Mount, Cat Companion, Silverback Gorilla, Mecha Titans, Nuclear Barrel Bot, Stargate Portal, Chakra Armor, rideable Attractions\n\n[ ADMIN & MODERATION ]\n- Give Fake Admin to any player + admin command list\n- Moderator tab: Bring All, Explode Player (15 TNT), Spawn Trapper, Whitelist & Focus Target\n- Anti Hackers tab: freeze, black screen and neutralize other exploiters\n\n[ NO CENSOR CHAT ]\n- Send uncensored messages in chat\n- Chat Translator (incoming & outgoing) + Auto-Correct\n\n[ SPOOFER / BYPASS ]\n- Brookhaven Spoofer (Mobile permanent / PC live)\n- House Props Bypass: auto-unlock house props\n- VIP Items Giver: give VIP items to a player or the whole server\n\n[ TROLL & PROP ABUSE ]\n- Bring, Kill, Freeze, Void, Jail, Black Screen, Alarm Player\n- No Escape, Blind, Special Blind, Light Player, Black Expansion, Real Black Hole\n- Gun Fling, SoccerBall Fling & Aura, Vehicle Fling / Bring, Door Orbit, Tornado\n- Fake Chat Control, Couch Method, Stalker & Mimic (copy chat / movement)\n- Spin Player, Swap Positions, Warn Player (15 signs), Anti-Sit Void Trap\n- Server Destroyer (15 props), Custom Prop Aura\n\n[ MORPHS (FE) ]\n- Goku, Super Sonic, Hulk, Spider-Man 2, Faker, C00lkid\n\n[ PLAYER & AVATAR ]\n- Fly, NoClip, Infinite Jump, Speed, Jump Power, Click TP, FE Invisible, Desync\n- Copy any player's avatar, 5 saved outfit slots, Giant Mode, Baby Size, Mini Mecha Robot\n- Steal Items (one player or the whole map)\n\n[ PROFILE ]\n- Custom RP Name & Bio, presets, rainbow & gradient colors, full color picker\n\n[ AUDIO / HOUSE / VEHICLE ]\n- 71-track music player, FE Piano, global meme sounds, virtual piano\n- Unban all houses, rainbow house, bring cars, glitch / dislocate vehicles\n\n[ PROTECTION ]\n- Anti-Sit, Anti-Fling (vehicles, canoe, jets, helicopters, ball, doors), Anti-Lag